  "description": "Passage planning calculations for IHO S-100 data: leg ETAs and an under-keel clearance (UKC) engine that combines charted depth (S-102, with S-101 fallback) and S-104 water level along a route, and a route check against charted land, drying ground, chart coverage, charted dangers, the safety contour, S-124 warnings, and restricted and S-122 protected areas. Depends only on EncDotNet.S100.Core; data sources plug in through small interfaces.",
